voice-to-text (1.0.13) noble; urgency=high

  * SECURITY: Replace popen()/shell with fork()/execvp() in transcribe.c
    (eliminates all command injection vectors)
  * SECURITY: Pin faster-whisper/ctranslate2 versions in postinst
  * SECURITY: Pin whisper.cpp to tagged release in postinst
  * SECURITY: Replace system() with fork()/execlp() in gui.c
  * SECURITY: Add atomic types for thread-shared audio/keyboard state
  * SECURITY: Use mkstemp() for temp WAV files (prevent symlink attacks)
  * SECURITY: Add mutex to logging for thread safety
  * SECURITY: Fix NULL deref if HOME is unset
  * SECURITY: Lock file permissions 0600 instead of 0666
  * SECURITY: Add systemd hardening (ProtectSystem, CapabilityBoundingSet)
  * SECURITY: Add 30-second timeout to typing busy-wait
  * SECURITY: Replace system(find) with opendir/unlink for temp cleanup
  * Remove personal name from default prompt

